Anime-style wide illustration, clean line art, soft cel shading, gentle natural colours, cinematic composition, no text, no letters, no readable marks. Entirely underwater, no sky, no surface, no horizon. A long wide valley in a golden kelp forest, tall brass-coloured kelp trunks, warm gold light in shafts. Along the valley floor a long column of about nine hundred small people of all ages swims and walks slowly together, hauling wide sleds of pale kelp floats on ropes; old people and babies ride on the sleds; the column moves at the pace of the slowest. Grey tide hounds, sleek seal-bodied animals, work up and down the flanks of the column. High above, like clouds, hang the dark grey shadows of twelve large ship hulls, seen only as soft shadows through the water. The people are small figures in a wide view, simple but clear. Calm, patient, tender mood. Not a single readable mark.
